\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Cross-domain results of DCD. Each column shows a raw test image (top) and the DCD prediction overlaid in cyan (bottom). Trained on only 18 images from six Seen datasets and deployed with a single fixed candidate head, DCD preserves thin structures and connectivity on two Unseen and two Novel datasets.}}{1}{figure.caption.1}\protected@file@percent }
